{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/c78ed589b3b130dada80b1c029582342.poster.avif?t=1755994823\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/c78ed589b3b130dada80b1c029582342.webm?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/c78ed589b3b130dada80b1c029582342.mp4?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lythia: Sigil of Lust - Card Battle RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark elf warrior, Lythia, is on a long journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden rain forces her into a tavern for shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She accepts a quest to hunt a monster in a cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, a succubus curses her after she defeats the monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sigil appears on her belly, and a voice echoes in her mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Lythia must begin a new quest to break the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/09223c86586a2a89f086708359aaefca.avif?t=1755994823\" width=1280 height=730 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lythia:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A proud warrior is confident in her combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/08436bc58dc64c770fe476bd7a69aeee.poster.avif?t=1755994823\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/08436bc58dc64c770fe476bd7a69aeee.webm?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/08436bc58dc64c770fe476bd7a69aeee.mp4?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sigil of Lust grants her the power of a succubus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/4c6dc592ade9cd3bbceb37a96ae46190.poster.avif?t=1755994823\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/4c6dc592ade9cd3bbceb37a96ae46190.webm?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/4c6dc592ade9cd3bbceb37a96ae46190.mp4?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat features strategic card battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck from 75 unique cards to fight your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/6b2109c040ea91fd774a8e580884f5aa.poster.avif?t=1755994823\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835980/extras/6b2109c040ea91fd774a8e580884f5aa.webm?t=1755994823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http